WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,520 --> 00:00:02,420
what are you doing

2
00:00:05,010 --> 00:00:06,970
Who can get this thing?

3
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:12,040
Who can turn Lao Longkou upside down?

4
00:00:12,440 --> 00:00:13,440
I remember the way

5
00:00:13,840 --> 00:00:20,140
There is no need to leave the iron pillar in the picture

6
00:00:20,420 --> 00:00:22,460
Go find Zhao Jianguo now

7
00:00:23,020 --> 00:00:25,460
I want chemical protective clothing, green poison bottle, and mine detection gas.

8
00:00:25,820 --> 00:00:27,420
You prepare to go in first

9
00:00:28,070 --> 00:00:29,110
Bai Jingshan is dead

10
00:00:29,430 --> 00:00:31,230
But the people who stare at Lao Longkou have no desire to die.

11
00:00:31,550 --> 00:00:39,660
I won’t first remove this poisonous mine that has been buried for decades.

12
00:00:40,220 --> 00:00:41,820
Sooner or later, someone will blow him up for us.
